OL,3,AMan charged over fatal crash with
OL,4,Acyclists
OL,5,
OL,6,FA white Ford Focus was travelling
OL,7,Fsouth-west along Sole Street in Cobham
OL,8,Fat about 07:45 BST when it was involved
OL,9,Fin the crash, according to police.
